Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.24,0:02:01.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Warrior...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.04,0:02:08.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.84,0:02:09.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,will all
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.40,0:02:11.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.92,0:02:19.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Die !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.44,0:02:19.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Die !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.08,0:02:21.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Die !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:24.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kill him !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.68,0:02:47.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,His physical body can withstand the celestial sword ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.68,0:02:49.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only my original body
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.56,0:02:50.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be able to fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.28,0:02:52.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Scram !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.40,0:02:58.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kill him...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.68,0:02:59.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kill...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.04,0:03:00.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Attack together !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.16,0:03:13.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The invaders
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.04,0:03:15.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,must die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.20,0:03:24.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,No one’s chasing me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.40,0:03:25.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.44,0:03:26.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whatever,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.44,0:03:28.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,let’s just run for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.84,0:03:53.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I don’t kill this guy right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.24,0:03:55.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,I definitely won’t be able to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.76,0:04:01.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Invader, the punishment for destroying our tree will be
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.56,0:04:03.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,your death.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.56,0:04:05.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.40,0:04:06.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,grant your death wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.24,0:04:12.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your sword
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.40,0:04:15.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,is too weak !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.88,0:04:19.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,God Slaying Chariot,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:21.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,let me see if you are
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.48,0:04:24.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,worthy of your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.56,0:04:27.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's only a demonic beast ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.84,0:04:29.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,It will die !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.96,0:04:32.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,This beast soul is too slow...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.68,0:04:33.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.16,0:04:46.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.96,0:04:48.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can’t hold on much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.84,0:04:50.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, if you keep using me like this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.16,0:04:53.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,my Sword Spirit will dissipate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.68,0:04:54.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,This tattoo power
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.84,0:04:56.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,is truly formidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.96,0:04:59.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can’t stop me !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.64,0:05:03.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Help !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.24,0:05:05.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't need to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.84,0:05:30.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,This beast
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.64,0:05:31.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,is too vicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.44,0:05:46.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,This God Slaying Chariot
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.64,0:05:48.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,is really worthy of being called a celestial treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.64,0:05:51.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,But with my current cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.04,0:05:55.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,it’s hard to withstand the beast trap's spiritual energy consumption.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.84,0:05:59.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,The God Slaying Chariot takes too long to activate...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.16,0:06:01.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,In front of a 7-leaf Shaman,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.56,0:06:04.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,if it doesn’t activate in time
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.16,0:06:05.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:19.36,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1680,518)\fad(300,300)}Mu Ye\NForsaken Immortal Clan\N7-leaf Shaman
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:42.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Junior invader
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.64,0:06:45.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,was able to escape from my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.92,0:06:47.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,He has some skills...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.92,0:06:59.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(201,553)\fad(300,300)}Half a month later
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.24,0:07:07.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the enemy finds me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.76,0:07:09.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ll have no way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.36,0:07:23.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior invader,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.64,0:07:26.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,this old man has been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.52,0:07:33.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,With your lowly Early stage Soul Formation cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.04,0:07:35.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,you managed to kill a 6-leaf Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.04,0:07:40.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,You must be well known in the cultivation world above.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.64,0:07:43.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,What’s your name ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.32,0:07:47.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.56,0:07:50.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,The artifact you used to kill the Warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.80,0:07:53.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,is that bracelet of yours, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.08,0:07:58.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The scent of a beast
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.96,0:08:01.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,emanates from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.24,0:08:06.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,The exit is sealed,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.84,0:08:08.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can’t escape !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.88,0:08:13.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tell me the method you used to hide your presence
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.24,0:08:16.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I’ll keep your body intact
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.84,0:08:20.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,and plant a tattoo in you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.44,0:08:24.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,You will become my tattoo puppet !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.24,0:08:35.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have quite a few artifacts on you, Junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.76,0:08:41.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's a good sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:49.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,This item carries a hint of heavenly power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.24,0:08:53.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,But this is the Immortal Graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.64,0:08:55.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,tribulations
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.16,0:08:57.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,cannot fall here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.68,0:09:00.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a powerful pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.28,0:09:12.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,The cultivation gap is too wide,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.32,0:09:14.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can’t wait for the God Slaying Chariot to activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.64,0:09:22.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unfolding it, tearing it, or throwing it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.52,0:09:24.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,there must be a way to use this scroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:27.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,This scroll
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.72,0:09:30.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,why is it similar to our holy treasure ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.44,0:09:35.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now there’s only one way to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.24,0:09:38.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although it’s extremely dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:40.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,it is better than waiting here to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.08,0:09:54.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,A spatial rift...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.12,0:09:59.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,So what if you escape into the void ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.32,0:10:03.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,It’s easy to get lost in the void
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.28,0:10:08.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you can’t break space to leave from within
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.24,0:10:11.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where will you escape to ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.96,0:10:13.72,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(335,478)\fad(300,100)}Immortal Graveyard\NVoid
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.56,0:10:28.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Junior actually has a treasure to traverse the void...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.12,0:10:31.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,His identity must be extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.84,0:10:37.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,He’s the perfect candidate for my tattoo puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.92,0:10:43.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,This old man said
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.24,0:10:45.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,that I’ll leave your corpse intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.28,0:10:55.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a powerful soul !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.52,0:11:03.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Instead of waiting for my spiritual energy to run out,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:05.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ll take the initiative to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.24,0:11:19.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,You dare to continue to resist ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.96,0:11:22.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm just fighting to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.32,0:11:26.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,You want to kill the both of us ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.68,0:11:28.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,You overestimate yourself !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:46.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have put the first tattoo on your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.40,0:11:48.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if you don’t die
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.20,0:11:50.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will still become my tattoo puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.76,0:11:53.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,You got me good
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.32,0:11:55.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I’ll risk my life
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.44,0:11:58.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,to pay you back threefold !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.04,0:12:04.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,With both the celestial sword and the beast soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.96,0:12:06.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,even a 7-leaf Shaman
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.24,0:12:07.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,may not escape unscathed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.44,0:12:36.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I reached the 7-leaf stage
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.52,0:12:39.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,by understanding this tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.28,0:12:41.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.80,0:12:44.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,now that you have seen this tattoo,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.12,0:12:47.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can die in peace !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.64,0:13:10.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,To think my tattoos have been damaged to this extent...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.72,0:13:13.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,You fight like a cornered beast !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.92,0:13:15.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,The tattoo seed I planted in you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.08,0:13:19.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,is impossible to dissociate from your soul
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.84,0:13:21.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,unless your cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.76,0:13:23.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,surpasses mine !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.40,0:13:34.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,The rate of absorption is growing...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.84,0:13:36.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is most important right now
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.52,0:13:38.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,is removing this tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.48,0:13:41.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once my Origin Soul is completely enveloped by it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.72,0:13:43.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will become a tattoo puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.56,0:13:48.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,The tattoo spreads from the plant on my brow...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.48,0:13:49.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,The plant...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.84,0:13:50.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wood element !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.68,0:13:59.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Heaven Defying Bead !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.24,0:14:01.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since the tattoo is a plant,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.08,0:14:03.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,as it’s wood element
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.92,0:14:05.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,it can be absorbed by the Heaven Defying Bead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.88,0:14:06.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,This gamble
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.47,0:14:08.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,is my only chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.04,0:14:10.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Under the influence of the tattoo
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.24,0:14:13.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,he can still control his artifacts
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.48,0:14:14.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,and hold on for this long !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.56,0:14:46.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,It worked !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.44,0:14:49.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,With these pills and top-grade spirit stones,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.04,0:14:52.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I should be able to hold on until he exhausts himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.84,0:14:58.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why does this Junior have so many artifacts ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.92,0:15:02.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,He even has something that can remove the tattoo seed !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.92,0:15:30.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Senior’s guidance
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.04,0:15:34.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior has mastered the star compass’s teleportation ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.04,0:15:39.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,He completely removed the tattoo seed
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.04,0:15:42.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,and maintained this speed for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.68,0:15:50.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,That Junior has endless treasures...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.64,0:15:52.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I keep chasing him
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.44,0:15:54.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’m afraid my tattoo power will be exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.84,0:15:57.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.92,0:16:06.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,No longer going to chase ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.84,0:16:10.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(192,490)}10 days later
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.36,0:16:13.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,You’re courting death !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.84,0:16:31.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,My tattoo power won't hold for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.04,0:16:43.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.00,0:16:45.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,get the hell out of here !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.76,0:16:47.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you keep following me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.84,0:16:50.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,don’t blame this old man for taking your life !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.12,0:17:04.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(182,563)}4 months later
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.52,0:17:03.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.88,0:17:04.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,aren't you done yet ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.68,0:17:07.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.96,0:17:10.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior can use this rare occasion
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:12.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,to refine his artifact mastery.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.56,0:17:24.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Apart from the rift we came from
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.72,0:17:25.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,there’s no other way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.72,0:17:27.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,You are
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.24,0:17:30.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,trapped here !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.88,0:17:41.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,This old man will send you to hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.56,0:17:43.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,you have no way out !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.32,0:17:58.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,No !!!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.88,0:18:06.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now I can’t leave this place
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.76,0:18:08.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you cannot leave either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.04,0:18:11.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,This old man won’t let you go !!!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.44,0:18:19.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,A madman,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.00,0:18:21.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,you’re a madman !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.08,0:18:26.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I hope to borrow the clan’s spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.16,0:18:28.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,to open a passage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.64,0:18:32.76,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1555,469)\fad(300,300}Ancestral Spirit Tree\NForsaken Immortal Clan
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.24,0:18:43.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.12,0:18:45.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,why did you destroy the exit ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.08,0:18:47.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to leave now ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.83,0:19:39.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To let go of the consequences of my actions
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.13,0:19:40.85,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}is to ignore the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.89,0:19:42.79,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}like scattered ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.67,0:19:50.27,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}As destiny falls
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.51,0:19:50.27,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.27,0:19:57.87,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}It makes the mountains lose their colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.51,0:19:57.87,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}wither and melt into rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.31,0:20:05.43,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Who can deceive
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.07,0:20:05.43,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the law of the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.75,0:20:08.75,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Countless generations
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.03,0:20:08.75,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}have tried before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.04,0:20:12.47,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}But how could I not catch my dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.87,0:20:12.47,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}within my warm fingers ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.03,0:20:16.55,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're at my side when I'm alone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.55,0:20:19.87,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.63,0:20:23.83,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.19,0:20:28.03,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.03,0:20:28.03,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.19,0:20:32.99,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.75,0:20:32.99,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the rules ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.00,0:20:35.71,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To run towards you !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.75,0:20:39.03,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.03,0:20:43.67,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}to cut down this tribulation with my own hands
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.67,0:20:47.07,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and break through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.11,0:20:51.75,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}All of that for the stars in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.20,0:20:57.43,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.55,0:21:01.35,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}If your soul is willing to wander,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.35,0:21:05.99,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}can I still take your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.03,0:21:05.99,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and hold them tight ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.15,0:21:09.07,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.07,0:21:13.95,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.96,0:21:17.23,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I dream of destroying
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.39,0:21:21.95,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the shackles of our fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.95,0:21:25.91,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.91,0:21:28.71,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the hardest to let go of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.79,0:21:32.59,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I want to be with you again
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.67,0:21:35.95,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}so I can look in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.23,0:21:41.19,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1500}Even for a moment, it's worth it.
